DELETE /orgs/{org}/attestations/{attestation_id}
Delete an artifact attestation by unique ID that is associated with a repository owned by an org.
Required: org (path) — The organization name. The name is not case sensitive.; attestation_id (path) — Attestation ID

DELETE /orgs/{org}/attestations/digest/{subject_digest}
Delete an artifact attestation by subject digest.
Required: org (path) — The organization name. The name is not case sensitive.; subject_digest (path) — Subject Digest
